OL,3,GNEWSASix miles of delays on M1 after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lane is closed on part of the M1 in
OL,7,FLeicestershire following a
OL,8,Fmulti-vehicle crash.
OL,10,FNational Highways said on Tuesday
OL,11,Fafternoon a lane was closed between
OL,12,Fjunction 20 and junction 21 on the
OL,13,Fnorthbound carriageway for recovery and
OL,14,Fclean-up operations.
OL,16,FTraffic in lanes two and three, which
OL,17,Fhad been held, has now been released.
OL,19,FMotorists have been warned there are
OL,20,Fcurrently delays of 60 minutes and six
OL,21,Fmiles (9.7km) of congestion on
OL,22,Fapproach.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
